anistream's Android player builds on mpv-android
================================================

android/scripts/mpv.sh is adapted from mpv-android's buildscripts, and the player's JNI shim
(libanistream_mpv.so, in android/Spikes/Player/app/src/main/cpp) and its surface handling from
mpv-android's app/src/main/jni and BaseMPVView.kt:

