What anistream changed: the build is one script with pinned, checksummed sources; FFmpeg is
configured without --enable-gpl and mpv with -Dgpl=false, so both are LGPL builds; libmpv.so
links its dependencies and libc++ statically and exports only mpv_*; there is no Lua or libcurl;
and the shim keeps one state per mpv handle, so a second mpv can make seek previews.

The libraries the build produces carry their own licences, which the build copies to
android/.mpv/<pin>/licenses.
